      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "戻ってきたのね、ご主人くんっ。\nちょうどよかったわ、実は……メジエ様が\nいなくなってしまったのよ～！",
      "jp_sha256": "2bd382f1b88343a6e5815df8b51f33eebf3ec50946787c57453a7718c423a74f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "돌아왔구나, 주인 군.\n마침 잘됐어. 실은…… 메지에님이\n사라져 버리셨어～!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "27267d1c1990d69e542a936455bea842bfb0817a69e52ea822d81168a308dcc6:000002_4257217428580499166:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ミィマ",
        "Emt5_Sca",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "戻ってきたのね、ご主人くんっ。\nちょうどよかったわ、実は……メジエ様が\nいなくなってしまったのよ～！",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ミィマ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "169e40cfa39853502b0a29756366ad8b18ca694e3f3748269c17c4677a4d4fa7",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "えぇ！？　今度はメジエさんまで？\nもしかして、石碑の暗号を解く手がかりを見つけた、\nとか言ってませんでしたか？",
      "jp_sha256": "ce86742903aa9e01ef7b859a50e5f8efbf32853a76b393c00a3e7ef07911e95f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "네에!? 이번에는 메지에 씨까지요?\n혹시 비석 암호를 풀 단서를 찾았다는\n말 같은 건 안 했나요?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "27267d1c1990d69e542a936455bea842bfb0817a69e52ea822d81168a308dcc6:000002_4257217428580499166:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "えぇ！？　今度はメジエさんまで？\nもしかして、石碑の暗号を解く手がかりを見つけた、\nとか言ってませんでしたか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "21223eadc972665f6122795a32770f55f849204e1a6272f92ea5cc772f70bd13",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ええ、確かに。マミー娘たちに伝わる碑文があるのだけれど、\nそれが、この暗号を解くカギになるかもしれないって、\n私と一緒に調べに行くはずだったんだけど……。",
      "jp_sha256": "411cd5142f1f61d1f3bd342d43e249c706f8cdce57c1ed58e2d90af63fbaf978",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "응, 그랬어. 미라 소녀들에게 전해지는 비문이 있는데,\n그게 이 암호를 푸는 열쇠일지도 모른다며\n나와 함께 조사하러 가기로 했거든…….",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
